{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["See also: ",["l","鳟鱼大赛","Trout Derby"],"."]],["p",["The Rainbow Trout is a ",["l","鱼","fish"]," that can be caught in the river (in ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Pelican Town"]," and ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"],") and the ",["l","深山","mountain lake"]," during ",["l","夏季","Summer"]," during sunny ",["l","天气","weather"],". It can also be gifted by a ",["l","动物#Pets","pet"]," cat with max ",["l","动物#Friendship","friendship"],". It can also randomly be found in ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"],"s during Summer, or at the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for 195–1,000g."]],["p",["Rainbow Trout can be caught regardless of weather, time, or season using ",["l","魔法鱼饵","Magic Bait"],". On Summer 20th and 21st during the ",["l","鳟鱼大赛","Trout Derby"]," festival, Rainbow Trout can be caught in the Cindersap Forest during the entire day and regardless of weather. The fish can also be caught during Trout Derby without the normal restrictions in ",["l","农场地图","Farm Maps"]," with Cindersap Forest fish, such as the Riverland, Hilltop, Forest, and Meadowlands farms."]]]],["Map",2,[["p",["The Rainbow Trout can be found in the river and the mountain lake."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Neutral"]},[["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus